BUNDLED SOUND ASSETS
-------------------
The sound effects bundled with this mod (the .ogg files under
assets/teleport_animation/sounds/) are NOT original to this project and are
NOT covered by the MIT grant above. They are third-party audio, carried over
from the upstream Grand Teleport mod, and are included here solely so the
animation plays as intended, for non-commercial in-game use as part of this
mod. Do not extract, redistribute, sell, sublicense, or reuse the bundled
sound files separately from this mod. If you redistribute Teleport Animation,
keep the sounds only as part of the mod package.

This is why the mod's declared license is "Custom" rather than plain "MIT":
the code is MIT, the bundled sounds are not.
